    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43">

                <pb facs="0153" n="57" xml:id="pg57"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bryan to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Petropolis, Brazil</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1900-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                                1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 252.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm your cipher
                        telegram<anchor n="1" xml:id="d43-f1"/> of this date, and to refer to my No.
                    249 of to-day. I am glad to receive instructions which justify me in further
                    protesting against this obnoxious law prohibiting trade-marks in Portuguese, to
                    which I made objection both yesterday and previously at the foreign office.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Page
                    Bryan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
